#: pressledger/web/templates/jobs.html:90
msgid ""
"A job is summed across all print days — follow-up deliveries do not "
"appear as a separate job. Clicks are printed pages and the billing "
"figure; sheets are the paper consumption."
msgstr ""

#: pressledger/web/templates/own_use.html:13
msgid ""
"What the press printed for itself: calibration, service runs and meter "
"reports. None of it is billable, but it consumes clicks and stock like "
"any other job. Selected by job type, so this page is unaffected by how "
"runs are grouped elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: pressledger/web/templates/paper.html:25
