#: pressledger/web/templates/paper.html:53
msgid ""
"Sheets = simplex + rounded-up half of duplex pages; the machine counts "
"duplex pages as pages, not sheets. A grade is the combination of media "
"name, format, weight and paper colour — an empty media name means the "
"tray is not in the machine's media catalogue."
msgstr ""

#: pressledger/web/templates/paper.html:56
msgid ""
"All job types are selected by default: calibration sheets and direct "
"prints consume stock like customer jobs. Clicks are absent here — they "
"are the billing figure and cannot be derived from sheets."
msgstr ""

#: pressledger/web/templates/status.html:6
msgid "Data collection"
