#: pressledger/web/templates/status.html:17
#, python-format
msgid ""
"PressLedger fetches accounting files from every configured machine every "
"%(interval)s minutes, one after the other. A press does not run around "
"the clock — a missed connection is normal, not an error. The machine "
"holds only 99 files and then deletes the oldest; the local archive at "
"%(raw_dir)s is the actual long-term storage."
msgstr ""

